WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:16.270
Last time: AI helps, people stay in charge

3
00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:25.470
Chapter 5 · Capstone: Imagine Your Own AI Helper

4
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:35.360
Capstone = your big, final project

5
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:44.500
You're the AI designer! No coding needed

6
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:53.890
Meera's balcony garden

7
00:00:53.890 --> 00:01:04.780
Oh no! The plants are drooping

8
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:12.170
What AI helper could help? Think!

9
00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:23.020
Meera's idea: Plant Pal!

10
00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:26.490
Four steps to design an AI helper

11
00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:41.540
Who & job → Data → Privacy rule → Present

12
00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:53.260
Step 1: User = the person it helps

13
00:01:53.260 --> 00:02:05.400
One job: tell us when a plant needs water

14
00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:16.260
"It helps ___ to ___."

15
00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:29.820
Step 2: Data = the examples it learns from

16
00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:39.640
Healthy leaves and dry leaves

17
00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:50.410
Pattern: droopy, brown leaves → needs water

18
00:02:50.410 --> 00:03:03.000
Many kinds of examples make it fairer

19
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:18.470
Those leaf photos are its…?

20
00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:24.990
Examples! That's its data.

21
00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:33.000
Step 3: A privacy rule

22
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:49.560
Only collect what the job needs

23
00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:54.410
Rule: never store photos of people

24
00:03:54.410 --> 00:04:03.280
People stay in charge

25
00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:23.880
Spelling helper: which data is NOT needed?

26
00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:37.010
Home address! Only collect what's needed.

27
00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:43.500
Step 4: Present in about 1 minute

28
00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:56.200
"Meet Tiffin Buddy!"

29
00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:02.970
Speak slowly · Show a drawing · Smile

30
00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:30.730
Which plan is clearest AND safest?

31
00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:38.550
C! User, job, data, privacy rule

32
00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.480
Your turn: capstone challenge

33
00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:53.630
Name · who it helps · one thing not to store

34
00:05:53.630 --> 00:06:08.550
Plant Pal · my family · no photos of people

35
00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:14.340
Helper = user + job + privacy rule

36
00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:18.800
It learns patterns from data

37
00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:21.050
Collect only what the job needs

38
00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:23.700
Present clearly in 1 minute

39
00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:36.900
All 4 AI units: done!

40
00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:48.950
AI track complete!

41
00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:55.400
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
